1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Codex read captured sources and created candidate rules.
The shipped records were not produced by an external API batch.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Captured files carry hashes. Primary and supplemental quotations
must occur verbatim in their referenced source texts.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
One JavaScript engine serves browser answers and submission exports.
It evaluates a restricted rule language. Runtime makes no model calls.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Missing evidence remains unknown unless another condition decides it.
Calendar checks distinguish effective dates from pending proposals.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Regression tests challenge source tampering, jurisdiction mismatches,
malformed conditions, calendar boundaries and geographic provenance.

6
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
475 sample addresses have matched legal cities; 25 remain unresolved.
Exact quotations support review. They do not prove legal interpretation.
